#: src/clients/OneClickInstallWorker.rb:56
msgid ""
"An error occurred while attempting to subscribe to the required "
"repositories. Review the yast2 logs for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕາມຄັງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບບັນທຶກ (logs) ຂອງ "
"yast2 ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. Remove any removals
#: src/clients/OneClickInstallWorker.rb:96
msgid ""
"An error occurred while attempting to remove the specified packages. Review "
"the yast2 logs for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມຖອນແພັກເກດທີ່ລະບຸ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບບັນທຶກ (logs) ຂອງ yast2 ສຳລັບ"
"ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. if that was successful now try and install the patterns
#: src/clients/OneClickInstallWorker.rb:113
msgid ""
"An error occurred while attempting to install the specified patterns. Review "
"the yast2 logs for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕັ້ງຮູບແບບ (patterns) ທີ່ລະບຸ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບບັນທຶກ (logs) ຂອ"
"ງ yast2 ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. if that was successful now try and install the packages
#: src/clients/OneClickInstallWorker.rb:129
msgid ""
"An error occurred while attempting to install the specified packages. Review "
"the yast2 logs for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ລະບຸ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບບັນທຶກ (logs) ຂອງ yast2 ສຳລັ"
"ບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. If we don't want to remain subscribed, remove the repositories that were added for installation.
#: src/clients/OneClickInstallWorker.rb:148
msgid ""
"An error occurred while attempting to unsubscribe from the repositories that "
"were used to perform the installation. You can remove them manually in YaST "
"> Software Repositories. Review the yast2 logs for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມຍົກເລີກການຕິດຕາມຄັງຊອບແວທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານສາມາດຖອນພວກມັນອອ"
"ກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ທີ່ YaST > ຄັງຊອບແວ (Software Repositories). ກະລຸນາກວດສອບບັນທຶກ (logs) ຂ"
"ອງ yast2 ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: src/clients/OneClickInstallWorker.rb:159
msgid "No error occurred."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

